<main><section class="ei-hero"><div class="shell ei-split"><div><p class="kicker">Financial services</p><h1>Execution visibility across financial operations.</h1><p class="lead">Financial services workflows rarely stay within one application or organizational team. See the execution patterns behind the outcome, across banking, capital markets and adjacent operations.</p><div class="ei-actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="mailto:connect@revivetoday.com?subject=Banking%20Execution%20Intelligence">Discuss your workflow</a><a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/workflows">Explore workflows</a></div></div><img alt="Execution Intelligence visualization" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/images/banking/banking-workflows-evidence-to-execution-800.webp"/></div></section><section class="band"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><p class="kicker">Applications</p><h2>Where the work crosses boundaries</h2><p>These represent areas where execution analysis can be applied when suitable records and identifiers are available.</p></div><div class="ei-cards"><article class="ei-card"><h3>Banking operations</h3><p>Customer onboarding, lending, payments, servicing and investigations.</p></article><article class="ei-card"><h3>Capital markets</h3><p>Trade lifecycle handoffs, post-trade exceptions, settlement and reconciliation.</p></article><article class="ei-card"><h3>ETF operations</h3><p>Creation/redemption coordination, exception handling, custody-related handoffs and reconciliations.</p></article><article class="ei-card"><h3>Insurance operations</h3><p>Claims, policy servicing, underwriting and AI-assisted decisions.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><p class="kicker">Focused explorations</p><h2>Choose the workflow that matters</h2><p>Explore the existing capital-markets material and a new ETF-specific workflow perspective. These pages describe platform applicability, not a claim of customer implementation in every area.</p></div><div class="ei-linkrow"><a href="/industry-capital-markets">Capital markets →</a><a href="/etf-operations">ETF operations →</a><a href="/industry-insurance">Insurance →</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="ei-footer"><div class="shell"><img alt="RE-ViVE" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/images/revive-logo-inverse-240.webp"/><p>Understand how work actually executes.</p><p><a href="/">Banking Home</a> · <a href="/workflows">Banking</a> · <a href="/platform">Platform</a> · <a href="https://re-vive.com/">Corporate Website</a></p><small>© 2026 RE-ViVE. Product and use-case information. Outcomes depend on each institution’s data and environment.</small></div></footer>
</Layout>
